role_description = "A research bloom that outgrew its own station: bio domes swallowed by canopy, giant flora, spore vents in the moss, an overgrown arch where the corridor used to be, and the crashed lab the recovery team came for. Recovery mission — walk the grove and bring back what is still readable."
